That would make the Plane of Air easy, as I tame the first Air Elemental
that gets near me, and let it follow me to the portal, keeping all the
other nasty Air Elementals at bay. Or I just slow the first Air Elemental,
letting it chase me at near normal speed to the portal, also keeping the
others at bay. One of the hardest parts of the Plane of Air is the point
